From 4168fdc7ed4e5d311441fa0cb2bf3ef01582acc0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 17:59:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Hide the Admin tab on the passwordless shared Helfer link

The shared link (?event=<id>) already forces Helfer mode, but the
header still showed an "Admin" tab next to it, presenting the shared
page as an admin tool to helpers who shouldn't see that option.
Header now takes a showAdminTab prop; App.tsx sets it to false
whenever a shared event id is present in the URL.

